1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,760
A price alert tells you when a price reaches a level you choose.

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,930
Select an instrument in the watchlist, then press Alt+P.

3
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:12,790
The alert window opens on that instrument and shows its live prices.

4
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:16,640
Choose whether to watch the Bid or the Ask price.

5
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:20,000
The alert rate starts at the current price.

6
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,670
The arrows nudge it up or down.

7
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:26,290
Or type the price you want.

8
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:30,150
The line below tells you what will trigger the alert.

9
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:34,960
Click Set Alert.

10
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:39,880
Your alerts are listed on the Summary tab.

11
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:44,380
Here it is, waiting for the price to get there. Alerts are kept on the server.

